<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>nervousness</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Joon</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">nervousness</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">0REWgnJC74ACVsQcEMXI6w</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:00.622" end="00:02.122">Who wants a shot</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:02.106" end="00:07.809">Life's crazy right now</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:07.809" end="00:15.809">Oh, that's it I'm texting my ex</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:15.950" end="00:20.749">I'm supposed to have kids right now but I don't</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.749" end="00:22.249">Stay a little longer</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.247" end="00:25.606">So I'll let you know if we could've been</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.606" end="00:28.544">(Ah, ah, ah, ah, ah) Oh; Alright</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.544" end="00:30.231">Oh, I've been starting trouble</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.231" end="00:35.403">But it's nervousness that I couldn't feel</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.403" end="00:39.764">Oh, gonna blur my lines, little hopelessness</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.764" end="00:43.638">Could've felt just fine, but a girl could kiss</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.638" end="00:46.420">I guess it's funny when I'm talking to you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.420" end="00:49.309">Everything feels like a sin</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.309" end="00:51.479">Alright, sing it with me c'mon</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.479" end="00:54.278">Yeah, we could dine out</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.278" end="00:58.138">(Ha, ha)We're wasting money like it's mine no</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.138" end="01:03.623">(Ha, ha)I think it’s funny when we try our best and get so invested</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.623" end="01:07.090">Love could never make me a fool, but (Ha)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.090" end="01:09.120">It's the trust that I give</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.120" end="01:13.008">All the lust that I live for every night</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.008" end="01:16.841">Oh, I can’t act divine</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.841" end="01:21.747">I don't want to fall behind-ind-ind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:21.747" end="01:23.435">Sing it with me L.A</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.435" end="01:24.935">Stay a little longer</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.623" end="01:28.825">So I'll let you know if we could've been;Alright</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.825" end="01:30.469">(Ah, ah, ah, ah, ah) Oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.469" end="01:32.715">Oh, I've been starting trouble</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.715" end="01:37.919">But it's nervousness that I couldn't feel; Hey</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.919" end="01:42.044">Oh, gonna blur my lines, little hopelessness</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.044" end="01:46.139">Could've felt just fine, but a girl could kiss</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.139" end="01:48.982">I guess it's funny when I'm talking to you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.982" end="01:52.295">Everything feels like a sin, oh-oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:52.295" end="01:53.966">Alright, sing it with me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:53.966" end="01:57.528">Oh, things would never feel like fiction</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:57.528" end="02:01.655">If we read between the lines</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:01.655" end="02:09.655">Well it might’ve helped to keep some peace of mind, oh; I love ya'll</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:10.246" end="02:11.746">Stay a little longer</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:11.545" end="02:14.700">So I'll let you know if we could've been(Ah, ah, ah, ah, ah)Oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:14.700" end="02:17.687" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Won't you stay a little longer?)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:17.687" end="02:19.387">Oh, I've been starting trouble</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:19.387" end="02:23.248">But it's nervousness that I couldn't feel</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:23.248" end="02:25.030">Alright Los Angeles</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:25.030" end="02:26.981">I'ma ask ya'll one more time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:26.981" end="02:28.482">From the front, all the way to the f_cking back</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:28.482" end="02:30.184">I see ya'll standing up on there</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:30.184" end="02:31.903">Can ya'll jump please?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:31.903" end="02:33.607">I'm tryna make this room f_cking shake</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:33.607" end="02:35.107">Can ya'll do that, cmon</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:34.795" end="02:36.529">There we go</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:36.529" end="02:41.082">Alright, one, two, one, two f_cking jump</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:41.082" end="02:45.440">Feels like a sin (Oh-oh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:45.440" end="02:53.440">What did you do to me, oh, baby, no</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:54.893" end="02:59.486">Just stay with me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:59.486" end="03:03.083">Oh, baby, no</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:03.083" end="03:07.408">Oh, baby, I can't see, I can't see</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:07.408" end="03:09.455">Is it gonna work out?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:09.455" end="03:11.407">Is it gonna work out?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:11.407" end="03:16.780">Tell me please</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:16.780" end="03:18.343">Oh, f_ck</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:18.343" end="03:26.343">Los Angeles thank you so much</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:26.780" end="03:30.780">But we're not done yet, baby</p></div></body></tt>